{"unit_id":"yuhub233__dsh-effort-slider#card-zh","repo":"yuhub233/dsh-effort-slider","commit":"6f08315d16d4dd542b27c2f380a91c9e74295a59","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-effort-slider 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的推理等级滑条插件，在对话输入框工具行提供可视化档位控制。它读取当前模型的真实推理档位，并追加 Ultra 档；同时提供可选的闪电编排策略、按会话保存的开关状态、三种可选界面皮肤，以及子代理 token 速率读数。插件通过宿主模型目录写回档位，并将策略注入当前会话；适合希望在 DSH 中快速调整推理强度、编排方式和界面外观的用户。无需 API Key 或外部账号；偏好和模式状态保存在本机 JSON 文件中。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:77-105"]}
{"unit_id":"yuhub233__dsh-effort-slider#card-en","repo":"yuhub233/dsh-effort-slider","commit":"6f08315d16d4dd542b27c2f380a91c9e74295a59","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-effort-slider adds a reasoning slider to DSH, with an Ultra choice, optional Lightning policy, per-session modes, three skins, and subagent token-rate display. It updates effort through the host API and stores preferences locally. No API key or external account is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:77-105"]}
